  "menu.foot": "A vertical slice · procedural Milky Way · deterministic seeds",
  "menu.slotLoad": "LOAD",
  "menu.slotDel": "DELETE",
  "brief.premise": "You command a survey ship on the edge of charted space. The Milky Way is old — older than any civilisation in it. Somewhere in its ruins is the answer to why every advanced species that ever lived disappeared without trace.<br><br>Explore. Scan. Land. Gather. Investigate. Discover. Research. Upgrade. Go deeper. The history you reconstruct is yours alone.",
  "brief.flight": "<kbd>Mouse</kbd> steer · <kbd>W</kbd>/<kbd>S</kbd> thrust · <kbd>A</kbd>/<kbd>D</kbd> yaw · <kbd>Q</kbd>/<kbd>E</kbd> roll · <kbd>R</kbd>/<kbd>F</kbd> vertical · <kbd>Space</kbd> brake · <kbd>X</kbd> full stop · <kbd>Shift</kbd> boost · <kbd>V</kbd> view · <kbd>LMB</kbd> weapons · <kbd>RMB</kbd> mining laser.",
  "brief.interfaces": "<kbd>I</kbd> cargo &amp; market · <kbd>U</kbd> ship status &amp; modules · <kbd>K</kbd> character skills · <kbd>L</kbd> technology tree · <kbd>J</kbd> archaeology &amp; timeline · <kbd>B</kbd> civilisation database · <kbd>A</kbd> Galactic Civilization Archive · <kbd>P</kbd> missions · <kbd>M</kbd> galactic map · <kbd>N</kbd> system map.",
  "brief.onFoot": "<kbd>WASD</kbd> walk · <kbd>Shift</kbd> sprint · <kbd>Space</kbd> jump · <kbd>LMB</kbd> extract resource · <kbd>E</kbd> excavate artifact · <kbd>F</kbd> return to ship.",
  "brief.archaeology": "Artifacts are evidence, not loot. One piece of evidence forms a HYPOTHESIS. A second, independent piece CONFIRMS the event. Confirmed events reconstruct the galactic timeline and advance the main mystery. Some artifacts contain schematics for technologies that cannot be researched any other way.",
  "brief.risk": "Fuel is finite. Hulls break. Radiation kills. Anomalies do not care whether you are ready. Decide constantly: push deeper, or come home with what you have.",
